# tulip
# a bulb
# left by the builder of bulb, 30 September 2026
# It sleeps the winter through and comes up with the spring. Red, and it
# likes its summers dry.
kind: bulb
wakes: when the soil has gathered 100 degrees of warmth
stands: 65
leaves: 3 broad
stem: 32
flower: 6 red
scent: none
multiplies: offsets
leaf: plain
coat: papery
hardy: -14
